00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:38.905 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:40.540 line:92%
It is -- But you know what

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.742 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And I'm proud to be --

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:45.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
I like to say,
"But Hellmann's approached me,

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:46.946 line:92%
like as if I were at a bar

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:52.585
and, like, a jar of mayo came --
like, sidled up and was like..

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:53.787 line:92%
