00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:06.299
So I'm really proud with how
they're handling everything.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:09.335
And their business model
and they are doing so much

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.905 size:78% position:39%
to try to help people
with food insecurity.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:14.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
And also, they agreed --
And this is the coolest thing.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
They agreed to make
their best efforts

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:20.680
