any videos with hate speec

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.314 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
or disinformation,

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:25.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is, you know,
such a major problem right now

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:26.619 line:92%
And other actors and performer

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:27.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
