in their contracts, too.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:30.690
-I know that you sort of spend
a lot of time on social media,

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.159 size:84% position:42%
and we actually talked
about wanting to, like,

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:36.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
