when we've had conversations

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:40.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, how do you respond
to Internet hate?

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:44.904 line:92%
-Well, I-I think they're right

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:45.472 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I retire.

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:49.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, you know, I think
it kind of keeps me honest

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.210 line:92%
Like, I don't mind at all.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:51.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
And me partnering
with mayonnaise,

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:53.113 size:75% position:38%
like, I really think
that there will be

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:54.747 align:start size:94% position:6%
some great memes
born out of this.

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:57.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, you know,
it's the same thing

00:01:57.717 --> 00:01:59.652 line:92%
with, like, the Internet trolls.

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:01.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like,
I have always thought --

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:03.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, I've always known
that I'm cute.

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:05.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I'm just like, "I'm cute
I'm sorry."

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:07.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
