00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:15.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, yes, I'm partnering
with mayonnaise.

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:17.370 line:92%
And I think that is sexy.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, my good friend
Jennifer Lawrence

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:21.007 size:75% position:38% line:92%
is the face of Dior,

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:24.544 line:92%
and I am the body of mayo.

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:28.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have a beautiful baby boy
Gene.

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:31.384 size:81% position:41%
How old is Gene now?
-He's fine, he's fine.

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.486 size:78% position:39% line:92%
No, I'm just kidding.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.889 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-How old is Gene?

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:38.791 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Gene.

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:41.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know he's older than 1,
obviously.

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:44.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So can you just not remembe
Gene's age?

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:46.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, no.
I do know how old Gene is.

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:49.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
Of course!
He's my roommate.

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:51.237 line:92%
But he -- The thing is --

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:54.874 line:92%
Okay, he's gonna turn 2 in May

00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:55.909 line:92%
But, like, that's an annoying --

00:02:55.909 --> 00:02:56.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's no way
that's not annoying

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:58.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
to tell someone
how old your kid is, you know?

00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:01.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like, "Okay,
he's gonna be 2 in May.

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:02.649 line:92%
