00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:04.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
Get out your cellphone
calculator."

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:05.919 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Or, "He's 20 months."

00:03:05.919 --> 00:03:07.253 line:92%
It's like, "Is he the Messia

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:09.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we're talking about him
with that kind of --"

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:11.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
