00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:13.526 line:92%
So ask me again how old he is.

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:15.662 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-How old is Gene?

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:16.529 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-11.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:17.730 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Perfect. [ Laughs ]

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good, right?
That's the way to go, lie.

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:23.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's a very effective way
to answer the question.

00:03:23.136 --> 00:03:26.105 line:92%
I want to ask this, as well.

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:28.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, so much
of this parenting,

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:30.510 line:92%
as I'm finding out, as well,

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:33.012
you're constantly judging
how you think you're doing

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:37.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you feel
like you are a good mom?

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.119 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Actually, no.

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:42.288 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's interesting.

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:42.922 size:88% position:44% line:92%
You know, you don't know

00:03:42.922 --> 00:03:44.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
how good you're gonna be
of a parent.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I got some nice advice
from Natalie Portman,

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:49.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
