00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:54.801
And what I'm finding is that
Natalie Portman is a huge liar

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:59.072
Because so far my instinct
are all just dead wrong.

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:01.007 size:78% position:39%
And I've been reading
this parenting book

00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:03.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
