00:04:08.348 --> 00:04:11.651
We literally, like, you know
like a creep in a cartoon.

00:04:11.651 --> 00:04:14.754
We're like -- You know, or I'l
just drop down behind the couc

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:15.955 line:92%
and kind of like do The Matrix

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:17.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
just so he doesn't cry
and freak out.

00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:19.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this book, like,
page one is like,

00:04:19.926 --> 00:04:21.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
