don't sneak out.

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:23.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's really bad
for your child."

00:04:23.296 --> 00:04:23.963 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And I'm like, "Okay."

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:27.267
I mean, not to mention tha
we did name him, you know,

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:30.903
by accident, "Genital," which we
all saw in the carrot video.

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:33.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was kind of foreshadowing
