00:04:33.673 --> 00:04:34.741 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-This is -- For those --

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:36.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
Again, for who those
who haven't heard the story,

00:04:36.643 --> 00:04:40.313 size:88% position:44%
you named your son Gene,
and then his middle name

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:42.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
was after the comedian
