00:04:42.815 --> 00:04:45.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it was Gene Attell.
-Right.

00:04:45.084 --> 00:04:49.289
-Which you did not realize
until you heard it out lou

00:04:49.289 --> 00:04:51.557 size:84% position:42% line:92%
sounded like "genital."

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:52.592 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That's right.

00:04:52.592 --> 00:04:54.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
What sucks now
is that you can never

00:04:54.394 --> 00:04:55.828 line:92%
